@startuml shop_web-overview
title Container - Web site - Overview
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam defaultTextAlignment<<atomic>> center
skinparam wrapWidth 200
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
hide stereotype
<style>
.composite {
BackgroundColor: transparent
LineColor: darkgray
LineStyle: 5
FontStyle: normal
}
</style>
person customer <<person>> <<atomic>> [
Customer
[person]
]
rectangle shop as "<U+00B1> Shop\n[system]" <<contains-changes>> <<composite>> {
rectangle shop.catalog <<changed>> <<container>> <<atomic>> [
<U+007E> Catalog
[container]
The books that are on sale.
]
rectangle shop.mailer <<removed>> <<container>> <<atomic>> [
<U+2212> --Mailer--
[container]
]
rectangle shop.payments <<new>> <<container>> <<atomic>> [
+ Payments
[container]
]
rectangle shop.web <<changed>> <<React>> <<container>> <<atomic>> [
<U+007E> Web site
[container: React]
The front of the shop.
]
}
customer --> shop.web : orders on
shop.web -[dotted,thickness=2,#E69F00]-> shop.catalog : **<U+007E>** browses
shop.web -[dashed,#7F7F7F]-> shop.mailer : **<U+2212>** sends mails with
shop.web -[thickness=3,#009E73]-> shop.payments : **+** pays with
legend right
**To be** compared with **As is**
|= Mark |= Box |= Link |
| **+** | new: thick solid outline | new: thick solid line |
| **<U+007E>** | changed: dotted outline | changed: dotted line |
| **<U+2212>** | removed: long dashes, narrow gaps, grey outline, struck title | removed: dashed grey line |
| **<U+00B1>** | something inside changed: thin dashed outline | |
endlegend
